  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Joint Programme on Gender-based Violence Prevention in Southeast Asia 2024-29</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A regional Southeast Asia UN Joint Programme delivered by UN Women and the United Nations Population Fund (UNFPA) focused on advancing the prevention of gender-based violence in all its forms. This Joint Programme was established to scaffold and support DFAT&apos;s regional flagship investment, the Southeast Asia Gender-based Violence Prevention Platform (INO051 refers).</narrative>
  </description>
